","merged_at":null},"body":"This implements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6795 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10815: A new method `_late_physics_process` is called after the physics engine step. \r\n\r\nThe following is still missing, but I can add this if there is interest in merging this implementation:\r\n- Unit tests\r\n- Documentation\r\n- Proper handling of the new `\"late_physics_frame\"` signal\r\n- Updating the editor to enable/disable late physics processing where needed\r\n\r\nRight now, `Node::FLAG_PROCESS_THREAD_MESSAGES_PHYSICS` and `physics_process_priority` are used for both physics processing and late physics processing calls. If needed, we could add separate flags/properties for late physics processing instead.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6795*","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102651/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102651/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}